#: ../../.opencode/skills/challenge-diagnosis/SKILL.md:10
msgid "What I do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/challenge-diagnosis/SKILL.md:12
msgid ""
"Define how an engineer's challenge to a bug diagnosis gets processed: "
"which mode to use, how to preserve the reasoning chain, and what the "
"`debug-investigator` should do differently in each mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/challenge-diagnosis/SKILL.md:16
msgid "Investigation History format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/challenge-diagnosis/SKILL.md:18
msgid ""
"Appended to the bug spec after each challenge round. Never delete "
"existing rounds — the history is append-only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/challenge-diagnosis/SKILL.md:21
msgid ""
"## Investigation History\n"
"\n"
"### Round 1 — Initial diagnosis\n"
"- **Date**: 2026-04-22T14:00:00Z\n"
"- **Agent**: debug-investigator\n"
"- **Root cause**: <one-line summary>\n"
"- **Confidence**: High | Medium | Low\n"
"- **Key evidence**: <what pointed to this root cause>\n"
"\n"
"### Round 2 — Challenged (layer)\n"
"- **Date**: 2026-04-22T15:30:00Z\n"
"- **Challenged by**: engineer\n"
"- **Feedback**: \"<verbatim engineer feedback>\"\n"
"- **Revised root cause**: <updated root cause incorporating both threads>"
"\n"
"- **What changed**: <what's different from the previous round and why>\n"
"- **Confidence**: High | Medium | Low\n"
msgstr ""

